{"seq":6,"slug":"digital-platform-capitalism","title":"数字资本主义与平台经济","stage":"DONE","category":"political-economy","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数字资本主义与平台经济\n\n当今市值最高的公司大多不生产实物，而是经营「让交易与互动发生」的平台。这个事实背后，是一整套生产组织、价值来源与权力结构的深刻变迁。本 hub 想回答一个总问题：当资本主义遇上数字与平台，它的运行逻辑、劳动关系与治理方式发生了什么根本性的改变？\n\n整个 hub 沿一条清晰的递进线索展开，四章环环相扣，不是孤立专题的堆砌。\n\n第一章「理论基础」搭建分析框架：先刻画数字资本主义区别于工业资本主义的整体特征（零边际成本、无形资产、租金化），再说明平台为何是介于市场与企业之间的新型组织，最后阐明数据如何成为一种性质独特的新生产要素。这一章给出后续讨论所需的全部基本概念。\n\n第二章「平台经济机制」深入引擎内部：网络效应解释了市场为何走向赢者通吃，双边市场理论解释了平台反直觉的定价术，算法与注意力经济解释了平台如何把人的时间炼成利润。理解了基础概念，才能看懂这些机制如何运转。\n\n第三章「劳动与价值」转向人的处境：机制高效运转的代价由谁承担？零工经济揭示算法管理下劳动者的风险下移，数字劳动理论追问用户创造的价值被谁占有，监控资本主义揭示私人经验如何被攫取为原材料。这一章把前两章的「机制」翻译成「谁受益、谁受损」。\n\n第四章「治理与未来」给出回应：面对集中与剥削，社会如何反制？反垄断试图限制平台滥用，数据主权试图重新分配数据控制权，数字公共品则探索超越私人垄断的替代组织方式。这一章把前三章诊断出的问题，接到制度与未来的出口。\n\n四条主线层层递进：从「是什么」（基础）到「怎么运转」（机制），再到「谁付出代价」（劳动），最后到「怎么办」（治理）。读完全 hub，你将获得一套理解数字时代政治经济的完整框架，而非零散的术语集合。各篇之间密集交叉引用，建议循着链接在概念间穿行，把知识织成网。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-capitalism-features","title":"数字资本主义的特征","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/foundations/digital-capitalism-features"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-as-organization","title":"平台作为新型组织","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/foundations/platform-as-organization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-as-factor","title":"数据作为生产要素","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/foundations/data-as-factor"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mechanisms","title":"平台经济机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/mechanisms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-effects","title":"网络效应与赢者通吃","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/mechanisms/network-effects"},{"seq":2,"slug":"two-sided-markets","title":"双边市场与定价","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/mechanisms/two-sided-markets"},{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithm-attention","title":"算法与注意力经济","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/mechanisms/algorithm-attention"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"labor","title":"劳动与价值","docCount":3,"url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/labor","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gig-platform-labor","title":"零工经济与平台劳动","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/labor/gig-platform-labor"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-labor-value","title":"数字劳动与价值创造","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/labor/digital-labor-value"},{"seq":3,"slug":"surveillance-capitalism","title":"监控资本主义","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/labor/surveillance-capitalism"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance","title":"治理与未来","docCount":3,"url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monopoly-antitrust","title":"平台垄断与反垄断","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/governance/monopoly-antitrust"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-sovereignty","title":"数据主权与监管","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/governance/data-sovereignty"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-commons","title":"数字公共品与替代方案","url":"/h/political-economy/digital-platform-capitalism/governance/digital-commons"}]}]}